{"id":"historia","lemma":"historia","pos":"noun","rank":232,"glosses":["history (the aggregate of past events)","history (the branch of knowledge that studies the past)","history (a set of events involving an entity)"],"ipa":"/isˈtoɾja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"historias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-historia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me gusta la historia.","en":"I like history.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440767"},{"text":"Me gustan las historias.","en":"I like stories.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440876"},{"text":"¿Es cierta su historia?","en":"Is her story true?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443806"},{"text":"Ambas historias son ciertas.","en":"Both stories are true.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/42607"},{"text":"Es una buena historia.","en":"It's a good story.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443436"}]}